.TH AVR\-BILLING\-PAYMENT\-METHODS\-LIST 1 "" "avr 0.1.1" "Avrea CLI"
.SH NAME
avr-billing-payment-methods-list \- List payment methods.
.SH SYNOPSIS
.B avr billing payment-methods list
[OPTIONS]
.SH DESCRIPTION
List payment methods.
.PP
.RS 4
.nf
JSON FIELDS
    card_brand, card_exp_month, card_exp_year, card_last4, is_default,
    payment_method_id
.fi
.RE
.SH OPTIONS
.TP
\fB\-\-org\fR \fITEXT\fR
Organization ID. Uses default org if not specified (see: avr config set org).
.TP
\fB\-\-json\fR \fITEXT\fR
Output JSON. Pass comma-separated field names, "*" for all fields, or "?" to list available fields.
.TP
\fB\-q\fR, \fB\-\-jq\fR \fITEXT\fR
Filter --json output through a jq expression.
.SH SEE ALSO
.BR avr (1),
.BR avr-billing-payment-methods (1),
.BR avr-billing-payment-methods-add (1),
.BR avr-billing-payment-methods-remove (1),
.BR avr-billing-payment-methods-set-default (1)
